# ============================================================
# SIMBAKES — Security Headers
# ============================================================
# File ini BERLAKU jika situs di-deploy lewat Cloudflare Pages,
# Netlify, atau hosting statis lain yang mendukung file "_headers".
#
# GitHub Pages TIDAK mendukung header HTTP kustom. Solusi:
#   (a) letakkan domain di belakang Cloudflare (free) — aktifkan
#       "Always Use HTTPS" + HSTS di dashboard Cloudflare, ATAU
#   (b) biarkan CSP meta di index.html/daftar-peserta.html bekerja
#       (CSP & Referrer ter-cover; HSTS/XCTO/frame-ancestors tidak).
#
# ===================================================================

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://unpkg.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co; frame-src https://drive.google.com https://docs.google.com https://*.googleusercontent.com; media-src 'self' https:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# ============================================================
# Panduan Admin & Operator — data isi buku internal
# Jangan disimpan cache publik & tidak diindeks mesin pencari.
# (Hardening penuh: jalankan sql/PANDUAN-ADMIN-BACKEND.sql, lalu
#  berkas ini boleh dihapus dari hosting.)
# ============================================================
/panduan/admin-data.js
  Cache-Control: no-store, private
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
